id": "alias_39aa3b4737e446", "text": "Mac 截图只截窗口怎么按", "status": "active", "reason": null, "source": "manual", "created_at": "2026-11-22T06:46:24.901+00:00"}], "versions": [{"id": "grp_mac_shot:v3", "group_id": "grp_mac_shot", "n": 3, "answer": "按 **Shift + Command + 4**，再按一下空格键，光标会变成相机图标；将鼠标移到目标窗口上并点一下，就能只截这个窗口。按住 Control 可将截图复制到剪贴板。", "basis": "还原测试改动", "by_user_id": "u-a", "status": "published", "created_at": "2026-11-22T05:55:03.098+00:00", "variants": []}, {"id": "grp_mac_shot:v2", "group_id": "grp_mac_shot", "n": 2, "answer": "按 Command+Shift+4 后按空格，光标变成相机图标时点击目标窗口，截图会保存到桌面。", "basis": "反馈处理：修正答案", "by_user_id": "u-a", "status": "superseded", "created_at": "2026-11-22T05:54:56.195+00:00", "variants": []}, {"id": "grp_mac_shot:v1", "group_id": "grp_mac_shot", "n": 1, "answer": "按 **Shift + Command + 4**，再按一下空格键，光标会变成相机图标；将鼠标移到目标窗口上并点一下，就能只截这个窗口。按住 Control 可将截图复制到剪贴板。", "basis": "演示知识样例", "by_user_id": "u-a", "status": "superseded", "created_at": "2026-11-20T17:49:29.612+00:00", "variants": []}], "suspensions": [], "can_manage": true}